// vani-lang: cherokee
//
// Phase 13.33: Cherokee (ᏣᎳᎩ) syllabary — endangered (~2K
// speakers). vāṇी gives the syllabary a programming-language
// host. Minimal keyword set in v1.

ᎤᎲᏍᏛ "Compute a small score with checked constraints";

ᏗᎦᏬᏂᎯᏍᏗ add(a: i64, b: i64) -> i64 {
  ᏗᎬᏎᏗ a + b;
}

ᏗᎦᏬᏂᎯᏍᏗ main() -> i64 {
  ᎠᏁᎳ x: i64 = 20 + 22;
  ᎠᎴᏂᏍᎬᎢ x;
  ᏗᎬᏎᏗ 0;
}
